{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/5a6940eae83a4bacabc478cceb895841"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/d45022c726604c40ad6981f5cee044d8"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/0468af07603a4c2fa394bd7dd417021f"}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/5a6940eae83a4bacabc478cceb895841","stringItemText":"Geotechnical Investigations"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/d45022c726604c40ad6981f5cee044d8","stringItemText":"Concrete Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/0468af07603a4c2fa394bd7dd417021f","stringItemText":"Soil Testing"}],"settingsData":[]}
